<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Rescue</h1>
<p>SKILL
</p><p>Class: Dark Knight (guild level 0), Fighter (guild level 1, up to 70%), Paladin (guild level 0), Ranger (guild level 0, up to 90%)
Also taught by: Gustav, in the back room of the inn in Udgaard (anyone, up to 35%); Brother Johannes, at the monastery in the vineyards near Nymgaard (from level 40)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>rescue &lt;character&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>rescue asta
</pre>
<p>To help a friend in trouble, use this command. You jump between your friend and 
the one fighting them, so that the attacker fights you instead and your friend 
gets out of the battle; if you succeed, that is. It is a test of your rescue 
skill and dexterity against the attacker's dexterity. If you lead the
group and your friend follows you, your leadership skill helps.
</p><p>You can only rescue someone who is being attacked, and not from yourself.
You can rescue while you are fighting yourself.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Groups</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Assist</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fleeing</a>
</pre>




</div>